-anchor="start">enum-values-removed</text><text x="330" y="159" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif" font-size="10.5" fill="#78716c" text-anchor="start">carries the safety bit</text><text x="560" y="159" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#78716c" text-anchor="start">→ <!-- -->notify</text><g><line x1="700" y1="155" x2="711.2" y2="155" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line><line x1="711.2" y1="150.1" x2="711.2" y2="159.9" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line></g><text x="720" y="159" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#c2410c" text-anchor="start" letter-spacing="0.14em">HOLD</text><g><line x1="858" y1="155" x2="869.2" y2="155" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line><line x1="869.2" y1="150.1" x2="869.2" y2="159.9" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line></g><text x="878" y="159" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#c2410c" text-anchor="start" letter-spacing="0.14em">HOLD</text></g><g><line x1="20" y1="167" x2="980" y2="167" stroke="#e7e5e4" stroke-width="1"></line><rect x="12" y="172" width="2" height="15" fill="#ea580c"></rect><text x="20" y="184" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11.5" fill="#0a0a0a" text-anchor="start">param-mirrored-to-header</text><text x="330" y="184" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif" font-size="10.5" fill="#78716c" text-anchor="start">carries the safety bit</text><text x="560" y="184" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#78716c" text-anchor="start">→ <!-- -->notify</text><g><line x1="700" y1="180" x2="711.2" y2="180" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line><line x1="711.2" y1="175.1" x2="711.2" y2="184.9" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line></g><text x="720" y="184" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#c2410c" text-anchor="start" letter-spacing="0.14em">HOLD</text><g><line x1="858" y1="180" x2="869.2" y2="180" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line><line x1="869.2" y1="175.1" x2="869.2" y2="184.9" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line></g><text x="878" y="184" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#c2410c" text-anchor="start" letter-spacing="0.14em">HOLD</text></g><g><line x1="20" y1="192" x2="980" y2="192" stroke="#e7e5e4" stroke-width="1"></line><rect x="12" y="197" width="2" height="15" fill="#ea580c"></rect><text x="20" y="209" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11.5" fill="#0a0a0a" text-anchor="start">removed-param</text><text x="330" y="209" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif" font-size="10.5" fill="#78716c" text-anchor="start">carries the safety bit</text><text x="560" y="209" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#78716c" text-anchor="start">→ <!-- -->notify</text><g><line x1="700" y1="205" x2="711.2" y2="205" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line><line x1="711.2" y1="200.1" x2="711.2" y2="209.9" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line></g><text x="720" y="209" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#c2410c" text-anchor="start" letter-spacing="0.14em">HOLD</text><g><line x1="858" y1="205" x2="869.2" y2="205" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line><line x1="869.2" y1="200.1" x2="869.2" y2="209.9" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line></g><text x="878" y="209" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#c2410c" text-anchor="start" letter-spacing="0.14em">HOLD</text></g><g><line x1="20" y1="217" x2="980" y2="217" stroke="#e7e5e4" stroke-width="1"></line><rect x="12" y="222" width="2" height="15" fill="#ea580c"></rect><text x="20" y="234" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11.5" fill="#0a0a0a" text-anchor="start">required-set-expanded</text><text x="330" y="234" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif" font-size="10.5" fill="#78716c" text-anchor="start">carries the safety bit</text><text x="560" y="234" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#78716c" text-anchor="start">→ <!-- -->notify</text><g><line x1="700" y1="230" x2="711.2" y2="230" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line><line x1="711.2" y1="225.1" x2="711.2" y2="234.9" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line></g><text x="720" y="234" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#c2410c" text-anchor="start" letter-spacing="0.14em">HOLD</text><g><line x1="858" y1="230" x2="869.2" y2="230" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line><line x1="869.2" y1="225.1" x2="869.2" y2="234.9" stroke="#c2410c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></line></g><text x="878" y="234" font-family="ui-monospace, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#c2410c" text-anchor="start" letter-spacing="0.14em">HOLD</text></g><g><line x1="20" y1="242" x2="980" y2="242" stroke="#e7e5e4" stroke-width="1"></line><rect x="12" y=